      <![CDATA[<p>其实我本来想部署matrix的。但是看了</p><p><a href="https://www.techug.com/post/self-hosting-a-matrix-server-for-5-years/">https://www.techug.com/post/self-hosting-a-matrix-server-for-5-years/</a></p><p>后转向了snikket。</p><p>注意部署Snikket后Snikket-Nginx将会占据重要端口比如443。</p><h2 id="如何修改用户权限："><a href="#如何修改用户权限：" class="headerlink" title="如何修改用户权限："></a>如何修改用户权限：</h2><p>进入Prosody</p><p>执行</p><figure class="highlight lua"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">room._affiliations[<span class="string">&quot;账户域名&quot;</span>] = <span class="string">&quot;owner&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>确认</p><figure class="highlight lua"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">room._affiliations[<span class="string">&quot;账户域名&quot;</span>]</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>返回owner则修改成功。</p><p>持久化保存</p><figure class="highlight lua"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">room:save()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>返回Result: true</p>]]>
    </content>
